# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-27 17:36

# game/prelude.rpy:24
translate english pre1_f69403b6:

    # "第二天，早上。校门口。"
    "" "The next morning. The school gate."

# game/prelude.rpy:25
translate english pre1_100401b6:

    # "还没走到台阶，云曦就把你拽到了路边的早餐摊。"
    "" "Before you even reach the steps, Yunxi yanks you toward the breakfast stall by the road."

# game/prelude.rpy:26
translate english pre1_1bb0cd08:

    # 云曦 "大脑不转，就别谈数学。糖和蛋白质，是科学部署。"
    云曦 "A brain that doesn't run can't do math. Sugar and protein — a scientific deployment."

# game/prelude.rpy:27
translate english pre1_30d8150f:

    # 我 "我是来报数学社的，不是来排队蒸笼的……"
    我 "I came to join the Math Club, not to queue at a steamer basket…"

# game/prelude.rpy:28
translate english pre1_90ce37ae:

    # 云曦 "豆浆两元，油条两元。我算过了：整套最划算。"
    云曦 "Soy milk, two yuan. Fried dough stick, two yuan. I've run the numbers: the set is the best deal."

# game/prelude.rpy:29
translate english pre1_deef65cf:

    # "你交出四块钱，换来一杯热豆浆和一根油条。蒸汽把镜片糊白了。"
    "" "You hand over four yuan and get a cup of hot soy milk and a fried dough stick. The steam fogs your glasses."

# game/prelude.rpy:31
translate english pre1_638a3388:

    # 知微 "……你们俩，来得挺早。"
    知微 "…You two are early."

# game/prelude.rpy:32
translate english pre1_336043c9:

    # 我 "社长？！"
    我 "President?!"

# game/prelude.rpy:33
translate english pre1_097d2ae4:

    # 知微 "我来接我的社员。——先站住，进楼之前，规则要说清楚。"
    知微 "I came to pick up my club member. Hold it. Before we go inside, the rules must be clear."

# game/prelude.rpy:35
translate english pre1_84e58c8b:

    # 知微 "七节课，一共五十六题。每一题都只有一次“首答”机会。"
    知微 "Seven lessons, fifty-six questions in total. Every one of them gets a single 'first answer' chance."

# game/prelude.rpy:41
translate english pre1_dc853c6b:

    # 云曦 "计分口径：第一次答对 +10，看了提示再答对 +7，第二次才答对 +5。两次都错——0 分，进错题本，归我管，归档服务顶级。"
    云曦 "Scoring: right on the first try +10, right after a hint +7, right on the second try +5. Wrong twice — zero, into the mistake notebook, under my supervision. Top-tier archiving service."

# game/prelude.rpy:42
translate english pre1_be540093:

    # 我 "……你们把入学说得像套餐。"
    我 "...You make enrollment sound like a combo meal."

# game/prelude.rpy:43
translate english pre1_ad4aeea7:

    # 知微 "今天的题，不难，但全是“第一次见”。吃完上来，教学楼顶层。"
    知微 "Today's questions aren't hard, but every one is a first meeting. Finish eating, then come up — top floor."

# game/prelude.rpy:45
translate english pre1_4ccef46f:

    # 云曦 "对了——早餐钱我已经付过了。要谢的话，现在可以排队。"
    云曦 "By the way — I already paid for breakfast. If you'd like to thank me, the queue starts now."

# game/prelude.rpy:50
translate english pre1_c7ea2242:

    # 云曦 "唔！突然正式道谢，犯规……已截图留证。这是我今天最好的一帧。"
    云曦 "Ugh! A sudden formal thank-you is a foul... Screenshot saved as evidence. My best frame of the day."

# game/prelude.rpy:53
translate english pre1_63998d17:

    # 知微 "……给我的？"
    知微 "...For me?"

# game/prelude.rpy:54
translate english pre1_096b0b6e:

    # "她接过还烫手的纸杯，指尖在杯壁上停了很久。"
    "" "She takes the cup, still too hot to hold, and her fingertips rest on its wall for a long moment."

# game/prelude.rpy:55
translate english pre1_98d967ea:

    # 知微 "谢了。走吧。"
    知微 "Thanks. Let's go."

# game/prelude.rpy:63
translate english pre1_e1e578bd:

    # "教学楼顶层。门上挂着一块旧木牌：数学社。"
    "" "The top floor of the teaching building. An old wooden sign hangs on the door: Math Club."

# game/prelude.rpy:64
translate english pre1_9d169be2:

    # "推开门，黑板已经被擦得发亮，上面写着一行粉笔字——"
    "" "You push the door open. The blackboard has been wiped spotless, with one line of chalk writing on it—"

# game/prelude.rpy:77
translate english pre1_0fa0c398:

    # 知微 "……你就是云曦介绍来的。站住，先别鞠躬。"
    知微 "...So you're the one Yunxi brought over. Stand up — no bowing yet."

# game/prelude.rpy:78
translate english pre1_294fd48f:

    # 我 "学姐好。其实我数学很——"
    我 "Hi, senior. Actually my math is really—"

# game/prelude.rpy:79
translate english pre1_39c8e56e:

    # 知微 "先等等。"
    知微 "Hold on."

# game/prelude.rpy:81
translate english pre1_7cd852d1:

    # "她把黑板擦翻过来压回粉笔槽，回身看着你，那眼神像在审一道没给条件的题。"
    "" "She flips the board eraser back into the chalk trough, turns and looks at you with the eyes of someone grading a problem that never stated its conditions."

# game/prelude.rpy:82
translate english pre1_6a117538:

    # 知微 "社长，苏知微。名字可以慢慢记，规则必须现在记。"
    知微 "President — Su Zhiwei. The name you may learn slowly; the rules you learn now."

# game/prelude.rpy:83
translate english pre1_0b149aad:

    # 知微 "正式入社之前，让我看看你。你叫什么名字？"
    知微 "Before you officially join, let me have a look at you. What's your name?"

# game/prelude.rpy:90
translate english pre1_e19a7014:

    # 知微 "[player_name!q]……好，记住了。"
    知微 "[player_name!q]... Good. Noted."

# game/prelude.rpy:91
translate english pre1_42a8985a:

    # "她转过身，在黑板那行欢迎语底下添上你的名字，写完又用袖口把字迹抹淡了一半，像什么都没做过。"
    "" "She turns back to the board and writes your name under the line of welcome, then smudges it half-faint with her cuff, as if nothing had happened."

# game/prelude.rpy:93
translate english pre1_f079f7d5:

    # 知微 "从今天起，七节课。我负责讲，你负责练。云曦——"
    知微 "Starting today: seven lessons. I teach, you practice. Yunxi—"

# game/prelude.rpy:94
translate english pre1_be0197ce:

    # 云曦 "收到！我负责啦啦队、错题归档、以及在你想跑的时候堵住门。"
    云曦 "Got it! I'm in charge of cheerleading, mistake archiving, and blocking the door whenever you try to run."

# game/prelude.rpy:96
translate english pre1_fefb1ef9:

    # 知微 "别吓他。……另外，今天八题考的不是计算，是“看懂图、分清词”。"
    知微 "Don't scare him. ...Also, today's eight questions test not calculation but 'reading the graph, telling the words apart'."

# game/prelude.rpy:97
translate english pre1_06b22045:

    # 知微 "见到 Δy÷Δx，先问自己：它住在区间上，还是住在点上？"
    知微 "When you see Δy÷Δx, ask yourself first: does it live on an interval, or at a point?"

# game/prelude.rpy:98
translate english pre1_9ace50b0:

    # 知微 "所谓“变化”，到底该怎么衡量——带着这个问题，进去坐。"
    知微 "How, exactly, should “change” be measured — carry that question inside and sit down."

# game/prelude.rpy:112
translate english pre2_e0aee523:

    # "傍晚，便利店。冷柜的白光把三个人的影子拉得很淡。"
    "" "Evening, at the convenience store. The fridge's white light stretches the three of our shadows thin."

# game/prelude.rpy:113
translate english pre2_cf781fbf:

    # 云曦 "今晚的课很抽象，补给要热饮——我给你们各拿了一杯。"
    云曦 "Tonight's lesson is abstract, so the supplies must be hot drinks — I got one for each of us."

# game/prelude.rpy:114
translate english pre2_fbe40a7a:

    # 知微 "你那个罐子是什么。"
    知微 "What's in your can."

# game/prelude.rpy:116
translate english pre2_6fd10265:

    # 云曦 "牛奶！牛奶不算咖啡！"
    云曦 "Milk! Milk doesn't count as coffee!"

# game/prelude.rpy:117
translate english pre2_26687e13:

    # 云曦 "真正该被审问的是你：昨晚 23:41 还没睡，今天 00:07 打了个哈欠，时长 1.8 秒。要不要我把那声哈欠录成上课铃，专门在你犯困时放？"
    云曦 "The one who should be interrogated is you: still awake at 23:41 last night, and at 00:07 today you yawned — 1.8 seconds. Want me to save that yawn as the class bell and play it whenever you get sleepy?"

# game/prelude.rpy:118
translate english pre2_aa6d4afc:

    # 我 "……你连我打哈欠都计时。"
    我 "...You even time my yawns."

# game/prelude.rpy:120
translate english pre2_c5452d7a:

    # 云曦 "只计你的。别人的时间不值钱。"
    云曦 "I only time yours. Other people's time isn't worth anything."

# game/prelude.rpy:124
translate english pre2_c1356827:

    # 云曦 "……归属变更：你的时间，归我建档。终身有效，撕不掉。"
    云曦 "...Ownership updated: your time is now filed under me. Valid for life. Cannot be removed."

# game/prelude.rpy:125
translate english pre2_d432b60d:

    # 我 "你的投影边缘，是不是变红了。"
    我 "The edge of your projection — is it turning red?"

# game/prelude.rpy:126
translate english pre2_feda4c41:

    # 云曦 "散热异常。原因：本条对话。禁止继续追问。"
    云曦 "Heat dissipation anomaly. Cause: this conversation. Further questions are forbidden."

# game/prelude.rpy:129
translate english pre2_b9204972:

    # 云曦 "拒绝回答。……三次。不，两次半——第三次是余光，数据无效！"
    云曦 "Refusing to answer. ...Three times. No, two and a half — the third was peripheral vision, data invalid!"

# game/prelude.rpy:130
translate english pre2_81de943d:

    # 我 "还挺诚实。"
    我 "Honest, for a machine."

# game/prelude.rpy:131
translate english pre2_e1858225:

    # "你挑饭团的时候，知微用指节敲了敲货架。"
    "" "While you're picking a rice ball, Zhiwei raps a knuckle against the shelf."

# game/prelude.rpy:133
translate english pre2_c9f769b0:

    # 知微 "今晚八题，一句话概括：全部用定义算。"
    知微 "Tonight's eight, in one sentence: solve everything straight from the definition."

# game/prelude.rpy:134
translate english pre2_d877bfa8:

    # 知微 "口诀三步——算增量：f(x₀+Δx) 减 f(x₀)；作商：除以 Δx；取极限：把数收出来。"
    知微 "Three steps, by the mnemonic — take the increment: f(x₀+Δx) minus f(x₀); form the quotient: divide by Δx; take the limit: the number falls out."

# game/prelude.rpy:135
translate english pre2_eae1aa6e:

    # 我 "卡住怎么办？"
    我 "What if I get stuck?"

# game/prelude.rpy:136
translate english pre2_19bd2138:

    # 知微 "退回三步。定义式就三个动作，做到哪一步卡壳，漏的就是哪一步。"
    知微 "Fall back to the three steps. The definition has exactly three moves — whichever move jams is the one you missed."

# game/prelude.rpy:137
translate english pre2_d38e2167:

    # 知微 "还有一种判断题：问你在某点可导。左右各算一次，两边不相等，就是不可导。"
    知微 "There's also a judge-it type: differentiable at a point, or not. Compute left and right once each — if they disagree, it's not differentiable."

# game/prelude.rpy:138
translate english pre2_30d33fa5:

    # 云曦 "反面教材叫 |x|，在 0 处左斜率 −1，右斜率 +1，谁也不让谁。"
    云曦 "The cautionary tale is |x|: at 0 the left slope is −1, the right slope is +1, and neither one yields."

# game/prelude.rpy:139
translate english pre2_4be3dc80:

    # 知微 "可导一定连续，连续不一定可导。这句话，今晚和考试都会感谢你。"
    知微 "Differentiable implies continuous; continuous need not imply differentiable. Tonight — and on the exam — you'll thank this sentence."

# game/prelude.rpy:141
translate english pre2_f90bf6cd:

    # 云曦 "结账！本次补给行动，经费消耗 0 元——因为社长说记账上。"
    云曦 "Checkout! This supply run cost 0 yuan — because the President said to put it on the tab."

# game/prelude.rpy:146
translate english pre2_e08894e6:

    # 云曦 "啪——！信号同步成功。今晚的错题率，预感：大幅下降。"
    云曦 "Slap—! Signals synced. Tonight's error rate, forecast: a sharp decline."

# game/prelude.rpy:149
translate english pre2_64255f8e:

    # 知微 "……抢什么，重物要放下面。"
    知微 "...Why fight over it? The heavy things go underneath."

# game/prelude.rpy:150
translate english pre2_b18bfb9f:

    # "话没说完，她顺手把最沉的袋子换到了自己那边。"
    "" "Before she finishes the sentence, she swaps the heaviest bag to her own side."

# game/prelude.rpy:153
translate english pre2_5c17f982:

    # "三个人提着塑料袋，走上教学楼顶层。"
    "" "Three plastic bags, one stairwell, up to the top floor."

# game/prelude.rpy:168
translate english pre3_0bbdd6e4:

    # "正午，食堂的人声像潮水。云曦抢到了窗边的一张空桌。"
    "" "Noon. Voices in the cafeteria rise like a tide. Yunxi snags an empty table by the window."

# game/prelude.rpy:169
translate english pre3_dab28261:

    # 云曦 "先吃饭，再谈导数。据我观测，你一饿，错题率就往上走。"
    云曦 "Food first, derivatives later. By my observation, your error rate climbs the moment you're hungry."

# game/prelude.rpy:170
translate english pre3_ce00c5ba:

    # 我 "你的观测样本只有我，这不科学……"
    我 "Your entire sample is me. That's not scientific…"

# game/prelude.rpy:172
translate english pre3_fb851c44:

    # 云曦 "样本量一，效应量巨大——这就叫显著。不懂统计的人，负责吃饭就好。"
    云曦 "Sample size of one, effect size enormous — that is what significant means. Anyone who doesn't understand statistics just has to keep eating."

# game/prelude.rpy:173
translate english pre3_c3afabf5:

    # 云曦 "另外，你刚才那半分钟看了三次鸡腿，一次表。优先级很清楚，不用我帮你建档。"
    云曦 "Also: in the last thirty seconds you looked at the chicken leg three times and at the watch once. The priority is clear. I don't need to file it for you."

# game/prelude.rpy:174
translate english pre3_1b4c1b26:

    # 知微 "下午八题。"
    知微 "Eight questions this afternoon."

# game/prelude.rpy:176
translate english pre3_30a8f5c5:

    # "你把手里的鸡腿举停了。"
    "" "You stop mid-bite, the chicken drumstick frozen in the air."

# game/prelude.rpy:177
translate english pre3_cd39cb48:

    # 知微 "别皱眉。今天八题是全场最友好的一课——基本公式表。"
    知微 "Don't frown. Today's eight come from the friendliest lesson of all — the basic formula table."

# game/prelude.rpy:178
translate english pre3_9a51f0e9:

    # 知微 "四类轮番出现：常数与幂函数，三角，指数，对数。"
    知微 "Four families take turns: constants and powers, trig, exponential, logarithm."

# game/prelude.rpy:179
translate english pre3_bdd31c82:

    # 知微 "做法只有一句：看到函数，先背出它的导数。背得对，题就对了一半。"
    知微 "One method, one line: see a function, recite its derivative. Recite it right, and the problem is half solved."

# game/prelude.rpy:180
translate english pre3_ddbabc71:

    # 云曦 "提醒：第三段是“组合拳”，会把两张表叠在一张题里。所以第一段起，就要练到条件反射。"
    云曦 "A reminder: the third set throws combos — two tables folded into one question. So from the very first set, drill until it's reflex."

# game/prelude.rpy:181
translate english pre3_5ea36289:

    # 知微 "每三题休息一次，是她替你们求来的。——吃。"
    知微 "A break every three questions — she bargained that for you. —Now eat."

# game/prelude.rpy:182
translate english pre3_a3bc272b:

    # 我 "……谢谢社长。"
    我 "…Thank you, President."

# game/prelude.rpy:183
translate english pre3_b2ffc7b2:

    # 云曦 "任务分配：社长负责夹菜，我负责监督你吃饭。"
    云曦 "Task division: the President serves the food, I supervise you eating it."

# game/prelude.rpy:188
translate english pre3_cd323750:

    # 云曦 "！……投喂行为，已记录。作为回礼，今晚的错题我少念两句。"
    云曦 "!... Feeding behavior logged. In return, I'll recite tonight's wrong answers two lines shorter."

# game/prelude.rpy:191
translate english pre3_f5faafb4:

    # 知微 "我不挑食。"
    知微 "I'm not a picky eater."

# game/prelude.rpy:192
translate english pre3_943f9542:

    # "她把鸡腿夹回来一半，塞进你碗里。这场让渡以失败告终，但她嘴角翘了 0.5 毫米。"
    "" "She sends half the drumstick back into your bowl. The transfer ends in failure — but the corner of her mouth lifts 0.5 millimetres."

# game/prelude.rpy:208
translate english pre4_1c53dea2:

    # "大清早，云曦说要带你上天台“给大脑吸氧”。"
    "" "Early morning. Yunxi says she's taking me up to the rooftop “to give the brain some oxygen.”"

# game/prelude.rpy:209
translate english pre4_bf21f1a0:

    # "天边刚泛起一点蓝，学校还没完全醒。"
    "" "A hint of blue at the horizon; the school hasn't fully woken up."

# game/prelude.rpy:210
translate english pre4_063d75ca:

    # 云曦 "今日冷知识：清晨背口诀的人，错题更少。样本量——暂时是你。"
    云曦 "Cold fact of the day: people who recite mnemonics at dawn make fewer mistakes. Sample size — you, for now."

# game/prelude.rpy:211
translate english pre4_aa91686a:

    # 我 "就一个人也算统计？"
    我 "One person counts as statistics?"

# game/prelude.rpy:212
translate english pre4_5bd0068e:

    # 知微 "三个人。"
    知微 "Three people."

# game/prelude.rpy:214
translate english pre4_568b4775:

    # "回头，社长正靠在栏杆上，手里拎着两袋热包子。"
    "" "You turn around. The president is leaning on the railing, two bags of hot steamed buns in hand."

# game/prelude.rpy:215
translate english pre4_9a9aed36:

    # 我 "社长为什么会在这里？！"
    我 "Why is the president here?!"

# game/prelude.rpy:216
translate english pre4_dea21497:

    # 知微 "我每天都来天台早读。……不是特意给你带的，锅里顺手多煮了一袋。"
    知微 "I do morning reading on the rooftop every day. ...I didn't bring this one specially for you — the pot made an extra bag by accident."

# game/prelude.rpy:217
translate english pre4_4b1f0b20:

    # "她把袋子塞进你手里，袋口朝下，扣得严严实实——凉不了。顺手到不像顺手。"
    "" "She pushes the bag into your hand, opening folded down and tucked tight — nothing inside could go cold. So accidental that it isn't accidental at all."

# game/prelude.rpy:221
translate english pre4_cf127134:

    # 知微 "……物理常识。热传导而已，和你没关系。"
    知微 "...Basic physics. Heat conduction. Nothing to do with you."

# game/prelude.rpy:223
translate english pre4_0f7e9d7b:

    # 云曦 "补充数据：某人 6:02 就在蒸锅前站着了。"
    云曦 "Supplementary data: someone was already standing at the steamer by 6:02."

# game/prelude.rpy:224
translate english pre4_337e8e9d:

    # 知微 "云、曦。"
    知微 "Yun. Xi."

# game/prelude.rpy:227
translate english pre4_683b33c7:

    # 知微 "……天台早上风大，感冒了算谁的。"
    知微 "...The rooftop wind is strong in the morning. Who's responsible if you catch a cold."

# game/prelude.rpy:228
translate english pre4_9ac6b7d5:

    # "她说完把脸别向栏杆外。晨光很好，把她耳尖照成半透明。"
    "" "She turns her face away toward the railing. The morning light is kind, making the tip of her ear almost translucent."

# game/prelude.rpy:229
translate english pre4_cbb37134:

    # 知微 "边吃边听。"
    知微 "Eat while you listen."

# game/prelude.rpy:230
translate english pre4_50b82f97:

    # 知微 "今天八题：和、差、积、商。"
    知微 "Today's eight: sums, differences, products, quotients."

# game/prelude.rpy:232
translate english pre4_d04c8beb:

    # 知微 "三句话背走：和差逐项求导；乘积——前导后不动，加后导前不动。"
    知微 "Three sentences, take them home: sums and differences — differentiate term by term; products — front differentiates, back stays, plus back differentiates, front stays."

# game/prelude.rpy:233
translate english pre4_424e42e9:

    # 知微 "商——子导母不动，减母导子不动，分母要平方。"
    知微 "Quotients — top differentiates, bottom stays; minus bottom differentiates, top stays; and the denominator gets squared."

# game/prelude.rpy:234
translate english pre4_5bda1917:

    # 云曦 "跟我念。念熟了手就不会抖。"
    云曦 "Repeat after me. Say it smooth enough and your hands won't shake."

# game/prelude.rpy:235
translate english pre4_7bdc4093:

    # 知微 "还有一条不写在黑板上的：能先化简，绝不硬求导。看到 (x+1)(x−1)，先展开。"
    知微 "One more rule never written on the board: if it can be simplified first, never differentiate it raw. See (x+1)(x−1)? Expand it."

# game/prelude.rpy:237
translate english pre4_37c89a3f:

    # 云曦 "口诀教学结束，进入考核环节——今天的包子钱，是谁请的？"
    云曦 "Mnemonic lesson complete, entering exam mode — so who is paying for today's buns?"

# game/prelude.rpy:242
translate english pre4_165fdc64:

    # 云曦 "一人一半，公平条约达成。……你那一半馅多，是我算过的。"
    云曦 "Half each — fair treaty signed. Your half has more filling; I made sure of it."

# game/prelude.rpy:245
translate english pre4_2a7b8875:

    # 知微 "……嗯，比昨天标准。"
    知微 "...Mm. More up to standard than yesterday."

# game/prelude.rpy:246
translate english pre4_83615699:

    # "晨风很大，但她点头的样子，比风更大声。"
    "" "The morning wind is loud, but her nod carries even further."

# game/prelude.rpy:249
translate english pre4_fc45fb9f:

    # "晨风把包子的白气吹散。楼下，预备铃响了。"
    "" "Morning wind scatters the steam off the buns. Downstairs, the pre-class bell rings."

# game/prelude.rpy:263
translate english pre5_dfd97ca8:

    # "夜晚，校门口。摊子的灯晕成一片橙色，汤锅冒着白气。"
    "" "Night, at the school gate. The stall lamp bleeds orange; the soup pot breathes white steam."

# game/prelude.rpy:264
translate english pre5_32d318a2:

    # 云曦 "晚课之前先吃饱——这是我的提案，社长批的。"
    云曦 "Eat your fill before the night class — my proposal, approved by the president."

# game/prelude.rpy:265
translate english pre5_db2e0baa:

    # 知微 "批了。今晚是硬仗，油箱得满。"
    知微 "Approved. Tonight is a hard fight; keep the tank full."

# game/prelude.rpy:266
translate english pre5_76ec9dd7:

    # "你要了两串萝卜，知微只点了一杯热茶。"
    "" "You take two skewers of radish; Zhiwei orders only a cup of hot tea."

# game/prelude.rpy:268
translate english pre5_082d81fb:

    # 知微 "链式法则，八题。口诀一句：先剥外层，内层原样抄，再乘内层的导数。"
    知微 "Chain rule, eight questions. One rhyme: peel the outer layer first, copy the inner one as-is, then multiply by the inner derivative."

# game/prelude.rpy:269
translate english pre5_57fb7960:

    # 知微 "比如 sin 2x：外层变 cos，2x 原样抄，再乘内层导数 2。一层一层剥到底。"
    知微 "Say, sin 2x: the outer becomes cos, 2x is copied as is, then multiply by the inner derivative, 2. Peel layer by layer to the bottom."

# game/prelude.rpy:270
translate english pre5_1b9115ce:

    # 我 "剥漏了呢？"
    我 "And if I miss a layer?"

# game/prelude.rpy:271
translate english pre5_d50c9eed:

    # 知微 "九成的错误都是它——忘了乘内层。错题本已经给它留了位置。"
    知微 "Nine out of ten mistakes are exactly that — forgetting to multiply by the inner layer. The mistake notebook has already saved it a seat."

# game/prelude.rpy:272
translate english pre5_941b8733:

    # 云曦 "坏消息说完，说好消息：今晚最后有几道三层套娃。剥得动，你就正式脱离新手村。"
    云曦 "Bad news delivered, now the good: tonight ends with a few three-layer matryoshkas. Peel those, and you officially leave the beginner village."

# game/prelude.rpy:277
translate english pre5_e31428de:

    # 云曦 "机、机器不需要暖手……但谢谢，收下了。温度传感器读数：很好。"
    云曦 "A m-machine doesn't need hand-warming... but thanks, accepted. Temperature sensor reading: excellent."

# game/prelude.rpy:280
translate english pre5_2b934674:

    # 知微 "……今天倒是乖。"
    知微 "...Behaving well today, aren't you."

# game/prelude.rpy:281
translate english pre5_df7875d3:

    # "她目送你起身，耳尖在灯下有一点点红。"
    "" "She watches you stand, the tips of her ears faintly red under the lamp."

# game/prelude.rpy:284
translate english pre5_809c7379:

    # 云曦 "（悄悄）检测到社长耳温上升 0.6 度。本摊最热单品，不是关东煮。"
    云曦 "(Quietly) Detected: the President's ear temperature is up 0.6 degrees. The hottest item at this stall is not the oden."

# game/prelude.rpy:285
translate english pre5_3b873811:

    # 知微 "……我听见了。"
    知微 "...I heard that."

# game/prelude.rpy:286
translate english pre5_9777c1fb:

    # 云曦 "本条播报的收听范围，正是社长本人。"
    云曦 "The target audience of this broadcast is the President herself."

# game/prelude.rpy:288
translate english pre5_77ce72f6:

    # "摊主大爷多塞给你一个鹌鹑蛋，说补脑。云曦替你说了一百句谢谢。"
    "" "The old stall owner presses an extra quail egg into your bowl — good for the brain, he says. Yunxi says a hundred thank-yous on your behalf."

# game/prelude.rpy:303
translate english pre6_e2085fe5:

    # "第六天。你桌上出现了一份不是你做的便当。"
    "" "Day six. A bento appears on your desk that you definitely did not make."

# game/prelude.rpy:304
translate english pre6_1c18b20f:

    # 云曦 "玉子烧、米饭、最后压了一块巧克力。今天的内容要同时开三个脑区。"
    云曦 "Tamagoyaki, rice, and a piece of chocolate pressed on top. Today's content needs three brain regions running at once."

# game/prelude.rpy:305
translate english pre6_5bc439eb:

    # 我 "……我怎么不知道我还有“脑区”这种设定。"
    我 "…Since when do I run on “brain regions,” exactly?"

# game/prelude.rpy:306
translate english pre6_07b13af4:

    # 云曦 "我编的。但巧克力是真的。"
    云曦 "I made that up. But the chocolate is real."

# game/prelude.rpy:308
translate english pre6_64dd5fb8:

    # 云曦 "……以及，做便当的人，正在等你夸一句。这句也是真的。"
    云曦 "...Also, the person who made the lunch is waiting for a compliment. That part is true too."

# game/prelude.rpy:309
translate english pre6_cc9619ff:

    # "中午，你们在食堂角落分食这份便当。"
    "" "At noon, the bento gets shared in a corner of the cafeteria."

# game/prelude.rpy:315
translate english pre6_0ef7121f:

    # 知微 "今天八题，三件武器：隐函数求导、高阶导数、切线方程。"
    知微 "Today's eight, three weapons: implicit differentiation, higher derivatives, tangent equations."

# game/prelude.rpy:317
translate english pre6_fe0da175:

    # 知微 "隐函数——整个方程对 x 求导，见 y 就乘 y′，最后把 y′ 解出来。"
    知微 "Implicit — differentiate the whole equation with respect to x, multiply by y′ every time you see y, then solve for y′."

# game/prelude.rpy:318
translate english pre6_98755a59:

    # 知微 "高阶导——再求一次就是。位移导成速度，速度导成加速度。"
    知微 "Higher order — just differentiate again. Position differentiates into velocity; velocity into acceleration."

# game/prelude.rpy:319
translate english pre6_50354603:

    # 知微 "切线方程——y 减 f(x₀)，等于 f′(x₀) 乘 (x 减 x₀)。找点、找斜率、代公式，三步收工。"
    知微 "Tangent line — y minus f(x₀) equals f′(x₀) times (x minus x₀). Find the point, find the slope, plug in. Three steps, done."

# game/prelude.rpy:320
translate english pre6_f8166bd3:

    # 云曦 "三种题型混着出，会轮换着骗你。但按社长的说法——它们说到底是一件事。"
    云曦 "All three types come shuffled, taking turns to trick you. But in the president's words — deep down they are one and the same."

# game/prelude.rpy:321
translate english pre6_0deb4cc0:

    # 知微 "……谁教你总结我的话的。"
    知微 "…Who taught you to summarize my words like that."

# game/prelude.rpy:322
translate english pre6_e885d148:

    # 云曦 "都在“变化”。好了吃饭，下午要考“见 y 乘 y′”的手速。"
    云曦 "They're all about “change.” Now eat — this afternoon tests the hand speed of “see y, attach y′.”"

# game/prelude.rpy:327
translate english pre6_0adcb590:

    # 云曦 "作者本人表示：奖励预告——明天的便当，升级。"
    云曦 "The author hereby announces a reward preview: tomorrow's bento, upgraded."

# game/prelude.rpy:330
translate english pre6_a6bcc531:

    # 知微 "……我只吃了一半。"
    知微 "...I only ate half."

# game/prelude.rpy:331
translate english pre6_62f87c83:

    # "话是这么说，筷子却没停。这就是同意。"
    "" "She says that, but her chopsticks don't stop. That counts as consent."

# game/prelude.rpy:347
translate english pre7_38415339:

    # "期末的早晨。早餐摊的队伍比平时长，云曦比队伍来得更早。"
    "" "The morning of the final. The line at the breakfast stall is longer than usual; Yunxi arrived before the line."

# game/prelude.rpy:348
translate english pre7_b8a7236a:

    # 云曦 "豆浆、油条、加一个蒸蛋。我算过——你所有“状态很好”的早晨，早餐结构都是这个。"
    云曦 "Soy milk, fried dough stick, plus a steamed egg. I've checked — every “great form” morning of yours runs on exactly this breakfast."

# game/prelude.rpy:349
translate english pre7_37eb11a9:

    # 我 "你连我早餐都建档？"
    我 "You keep a file on my breakfast?"

# game/prelude.rpy:350
translate english pre7_310ffca2:

    # 知微 "她建的东西，比这多得多。包括你对着草稿纸发呆的次数。"
    知微 "What she files goes far beyond that. Including the number of times you stared blankly at scratch paper."

# game/prelude.rpy:352
translate english pre7_fbcc7b49:

    # "知微付了钱，把热豆浆推到你手边。"
    "" "Zhiwei pays and slides the hot soy milk within your reach."

# game/prelude.rpy:353
translate english pre7_bfd71761:

    # 知微 "今天八题，综合。计分规则和平时一样，但流程只有一条——"
    知微 "Eight questions today, everything combined. Scoring is the same as always, but there is only one rule of the process—"

# game/prelude.rpy:355
translate english pre7_91bb8aa4:

    # 知微 "先看题型，再选口诀，最后落笔。概念题想图，定义题走三步，计算题背表，复合题剥洋葱，切线题找点找斜率。"
    知微 "Name the question type, pick the mnemonic, then put pen down. Concept questions: picture it. Definition questions: three steps. Formula questions: recite the table. Composite questions: peel the onion. Tangent questions: find the point, find the slope."

# game/prelude.rpy:356
translate english pre7_d93dd192:

    # 知微 "卡住就跳过。这八题不是按难度排的，按“像谁”排的。"
    知微 "If you're stuck, skip. These eight aren't ordered by difficulty — they're ordered by whose style they're written in."

# game/prelude.rpy:357
translate english pre7_44e8058d:

    # 云曦 "我在教室最后一排加油。社长会背对你擦黑板——但她余光一直在这边。"
    云曦 "I'll cheer from the back row. The president will have her back to you, wiping the board — but her side-eye stays on you the whole time."

# game/prelude.rpy:358
translate english pre7_11c603dd:

    # 我 "……你们两个，能不能不要在考试早上说这种话。"
    我 "…Can you two not say things like this on an exam morning."

# game/prelude.rpy:360
translate english pre7_851846f1:

    # 云曦 "为什么？数据说，被相信的人会多拿 8 分。"
    云曦 "Why not? The data says people who are believed in score 8 more points."

# game/prelude.rpy:361
translate english pre7_b809a30e:

    # 知微 "那部分归我出。"
    知微 "That part is on me."

# game/prelude.rpy:366
translate english pre7_bab5281d:

    # 云曦 "碰拳协议，达成！胜率加成已写入固件，撕不掉的那种。"
    云曦 "Fist-bump pact sealed! The win-rate buff is written into firmware — the kind that can't be torn off."

# game/prelude.rpy:369
translate english pre7_43ee2332:

    # 知微 "幸运粉笔。摸过它的人，上次考了满分。"
    知微 "Lucky chalk. The last person who touched it scored a perfect 100."

# game/prelude.rpy:370
translate english pre7_91b43535:

    # 我 "上次是谁考的满分？"
    我 "Who got that perfect score?"

# game/prelude.rpy:371
translate english pre7_96e9ecbc:

    # 知微 "……我。走吧。"
    知微 "...I did. Let's go."

# game/prelude.rpy:374
translate english pre7_3f4d328d:

    # "三个人带着空塑料袋，朝教学楼走去。预备铃在身后响起。"
    "" "Three of you head to the teaching building with empty plastic bags; the pre-bell rings behind you."

